OL,3,ANepalese authorities say 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing after flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said he is
OL,7,Fin touch with local authorities and
OL,8,F"will do everything we can" to support
OL,9,FBritish nationals affected, urging
OL,10,Fthose in the region "to follow guidance
OL,11,Ffrom the local authorities and follow
OL,12,Four travel advice".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
