OL,3,AMurder arrests after fire kills two
OL,4,Aincluding child
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe men, aged 23 and 31, had been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,8,Fwere in police custody, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
